#: kmoondlg.cpp:32
msgid "Change View"
msgstr "Cambiar vista"

#: kmoondlg.cpp:43
msgid "View angle:"
msgstr "Mostrar ángulo:"

#: kmoondlg.cpp:44
msgid ""
"You can use this to rotate the moon to the correct\n"
"angle for your location.\n"
"\n"
"This angle is (almost) impossible to\n"
"calculate from any system-given data,\n"
"therefore you can configure how you\n"
"want KMoon to display your moon here.\n"
"The default value is 0, but it is very\n"
"unlikely that you would see the moon\n"
"at this angle."
msgstr ""
"Podes usar isto para rotar a lúa e correxir\n"
"o ángulo dacordo coa túa localización\n"
"\n"
"Este ángulo é (case) imposible de\n"
"calcular dende ningún sistema de datos\n"
"dado, despois podes configurar\n"
"como queres que KMoon mostre a lúa\n"
"aquí. O valor por defecto é 0, pero é moi\n"
"improbable que ti poidas ve-la lúa neste ángulo."

#: kmoondlg.cpp:66 kmoondlg.cpp:97
msgid "Switch to Southern Hemisphere"
msgstr "Cambiar ó hemisferio sur"

#: kmoondlg.cpp:68 kmoondlg.cpp:99
msgid "Switch to Northern Hemisphere"
msgstr "Cambiar ó hemisferio norte"

#: kmoondlg.cpp:77
msgid ""
"The moon as KMoon would display it\n"
"following your current setting and time."
msgstr ""
"A lúa tal como o KMoon pode mostrala\n"
"segindo os teus axustes e a hora."

#: kmoon.cpp:80
msgid "&Settings..."
msgstr "&Axustes..."

#: kmoon.cpp:141
msgid "Full Moon"
msgstr "Lúa chea"

#: kmoon.cpp:184
msgid "New Moon"
msgstr "Lúa nova"

#: kmoon.cpp:192
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: Waxing Crescent (New Moon was yesterday)\n"
"Waxing Crescent (%n days since New Moon)"
msgstr ""
"_n: Lúa crecendo (onte houbo lúa nova)\n"
"Lúa crecente (Hai %n días houbo lúa nova)"

#: kmoon.cpp:195
msgid "First Quarter"
msgstr "Cuarto crecente"

#: kmoon.cpp:203
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: Waxing Gibbous (Tomorrow is Full Moon)\n"
"Waxing Gibbous (%n days to Full Moon)"
msgstr ""
"_n: Lúa crecente (Mañá haberá lúa chea)\n"
"Lúa crecendo (%n días para a lúa chea)"

#: kmoon.cpp:214
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: Waning Gibbous (Yesterday was Full Moon)\n"
"Waning Gibbous (%n days since Full Moon)"
msgstr ""
"_n: Lúa minguando (Onte houbo lúa chea)\n"
"Lúa minguando (%n días dende a lúa chea)"

#: kmoon.cpp:217
msgid "Last Quarter"
msgstr "Cuarto minguante"

#: kmoon.cpp:227
#, c-format
msgid ""
"_n: Waning Crescent (Tomorrow is New Moon)\n"
"Waning Crescent (%n days to New Moon)"
msgstr ""
"_n: Lúa minguando (Mañá será lua nova)\n"
"Lúa minguando (%n días ata lúa nova)"

